```
nir.fns.wants = ```nir
fn wants@6(k#8: fn() -> i64 shared S): i64 A = add<i64>(k#8(): i64, perform ask() direct instance() -> i64 legacy: i64)
```
nir.fns.asked = ```nir
fn asked@2(): i64 A = apply2@5(wants@6: fn(fn() -> i64 shared S) -> i64 shared A) tier A: i64
```

